      "id": "2095439405829718078",
      "text": "Here is what the Hong Kong silver token launch actually represents:\n\nNot just a new product. A regulatory precedent.\n\nHashKey Chain supported the first regulated silver-backed RWA token in Hong Kong. That means a regulator in one of the world's most sophisticated financial jurisdictions reviewed the custody arrangements, the backing verification, and the ownership mechanics and approved them for public issuance.\n\nThat regulatory approval is what transforms a product from a crypto experiment into something institutional capital can allocate to.\n\nSilver tokenization just passed that threshold in Asia. The rest of the world follows regulatory precedents.",
